{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"特征簇 (群)"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"特征簇(群)"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>群 $G$ 与流形 $X$ 对应的<strong>特征簇</strong>指的是 $X$ 上的 $G$-"},{"Local":{"url":"局部系统","text":"局部系统"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"模空间","text":"模空间"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>特征簇具有"},{"Local":{"url":"量子化","text":"量子化"}},{"Plain":"; 见"},{"Local":{"url":"量子特征簇","text":"量子特征簇"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>层范畴</h3>\n<p>特征簇上的一些层范畴可用 $X$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"分解同调","text":"分解同调"}},{"Plain":"计算. 例如"},{"Local":{"url":"拟凝聚层","text":"拟凝聚层"}},{"Plain":"范畴 $\\mathsf{QCoh}()$ 是表示范畴 $\\mathsf{Rep}(G)$ 的分解同调.</p>\n"}]}}